# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:352
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_045c8eab:

    # "Interrupting us, the crowd suddenly roared with cheers as Queen Adelaide and King Mesamor came to the podium, smiling and waving down at us in their luxurious royal wear, their arrogant son absent as usual."
    "Interrompendo-nos, a multidão de repente rugiu com vivas quando a Rainha Adelaide e o Rei Mesamor vieram ao pódio, sorrindo e acenando para nós em seus luxuosos trajes reais, com seu filho arrogante ausente, como de costume."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:353
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1394dc9c:

    # "The Queen was a beauty, there was no doubt about that. Many a crude joke had been told in private amongst boys wishing they were her personal squires, helping to {i}tend to ALL her needs...{/i}"
    "A rainha era uma beldade, não havia dúvida sobre isso. Muitas piadas grosseiras foram contadas em particular entre garotos desejando serem seus escudeiros pessoais, ajudando a {i}cuidar de TODAS as suas necessidades...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:354
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0ce3c759:

    # "She was a woman who was respected, but she was not loved."
    "Ela era uma mulher respeitada, mas não amada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:355
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_65b84426:

    # "She did send money towards charity endeavours such as orphanages, but rarely wanted to be seen by the common people unless some official decorum demanded it, such as this occasion."
    "Ela de fato enviava dinheiro para iniciativas de caridade, como orfanatos, mas raramente queria ser vista pelas pessoas comuns, a menos que algum decoro oficial o exigisse, como nesta ocasião."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:356
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6590881b:

    # "Thankfully, she did not rule alone."
    "Felizmente, ela não governava sozinha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:357
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0eb08be8:

    # "The King smiled, but his eyes were heavy, after all, it had been several years since he’d been deposed in 1156 by our ‘Emperor,’ and he now occupied only a figurehead position..."
    "O Rei sorriu, mas seus olhos estavam pesados, afinal, já fazia vários anos desde que ele havia sido deposto em 1156 pelo nosso 'Imperador', e agora ocupava apenas uma posição figurativa..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:358
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_304f39b7:

    # "{i}But...{/i} despite this, he remained popular amongst the people, a symbol of the will to keep persevering in the fight against the Demorai... even though he now had only a shadow of his former power."
    "{i}Mas...{/i} apesar disso, ele permaneceu popular entre o povo, um símbolo da vontade de continuar perseverando na luta contra os Demorai... mesmo que agora tivesse apenas uma sombra de seu antigo poder."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:359
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5c0c262d:

    # "{i}Ironic,{/i} given that at the time the people would have had his head on a stick for his handling of the war."
    "{i}Irônico,{/i} dado que na época o povo teria colocado sua cabeça numa estaca por sua condução da guerra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:360
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_206a036b:

    # "I guess that time allows people to romanticise anyone if enough of it goes by."
    "Acho que o tempo permite que as pessoas romantizem qualquer um se passar o suficiente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:361
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b2159af0:

    # ADARA @ talk "Where’s the Princess? Can you see her?"
    ADARA @ talk "Onde está a Princesa? Você consegue vê-la?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:362
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd8ebdee:

    # MC "No, is she—"
    MC "Não, ela está—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:363
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_06b7173d:

    # RANDOM_MAN "LOOK! IT’S THE PRINCESS!"
    RANDOM_MAN "OLHEM! É A PRINCESA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:368
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9988f46e:

    # "Nervously stepping out onto the balcony, the beautiful Princess Cecilia smiled and waved at the crowds timidly. Adored and loved by all, {i}the realm’s Princess{/i} was renowned for her charitable and kind nature."
    "Saindo nervosamente para a varanda, a bela Princesa Cecília sorriu e acenou timidamente para as multidões. Adorada e amada por todos, {i}a Princesa do reino{/i} era conhecida por sua natureza caridosa e gentil."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:369
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_120bafa6:

    # "I don’t think there was a single hot-blooded male that hadn’t dreamed about her at some point or another, me and Markus included."
    "Não acho que existisse um único homem de sangue quente que não tivesse sonhado com ela em algum momento, eu e Markus inclusive."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:370
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2eff982e:

    # "I must have had a thousand dreams where I climbed into her chambers through a window and we stole away together and—"
    "Devo ter tido mil sonhos em que eu escalava até seus aposentos por uma janela e nós fugíamos juntos e—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:376
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9441240c:

    # "Markus reappeared from the crowd and playfully grabbed my shoulder, squeezing it tightly as he leaned over to speak in my ear."
    "Markus reapareceu da multidão e agarrou o meu ombro de brincadeira, apertando-o com força enquanto se inclinava para falar no meu ouvido."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:377
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd3b5f70:

    # MARKUS "So, when we get to the Royal Court, which one you chasing?"
    MARKUS "Então, quando chegarmos à Corte Real, atrás de qual você vai?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:378
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_10a2efba:

    # ADARA @ shock "Markus!"
    ADARA @ shock "Marcos!"

