    MARKUS "Ai! Porra! Isso doeu!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:417
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_10b26e90:

    # ADARA @ angry "Hmph! Teach you to be so crude..."
    ADARA @ angry "Hmph! Isso te ensina a ser tão grosseiro..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:420
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e3aa6700:

    # ADARA @ shock "S-Shut up!"
    ADARA @ shock "C-Cala a boca!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:421
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_762dcae9:

    # ADARA @ angry "Someone has to stop you idiots getting your heads put on sticks!"
    ADARA @ angry "Alguém tem que impedir vocês, idiotas, de terem suas cabeças enfiadas em estacas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:430
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ea8481dd:

    # "The murmurs of the crowd died down suddenly; the sense of festivities soon became eerie silence."
    "Os murmúrios da multidão cessaram de repente; o clima festivo logo se transformou em um silêncio sinistro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:431
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_33948c6a:

    # "All heads turned to see our ‘Emperor’, Kendrick Alcott, as he slowly made his way towards the podium, donned in his thick golden armour that clanged with every step, his elite guard marching behind."
    "Todas as cabeças se viraram para ver nosso ‘Imperador’, Kendrick Alcott, enquanto ele se dirigia lentamente ao pódio, vestido em sua pesada armadura dourada que retinha a cada passo, sua guarda de elite marchando atrás."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:432
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_842aed12:

    # "There were murmurs and whispers amongst the crowd, Alcott was not popular by any metric, but he was respected, and above all... {i}feared.{/i}"
    "Havia murmúrios e sussurros entre a multidão; Alcott não era popular de forma alguma, mas era respeitado e, acima de tudo... {i}temido.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:435
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8ff1bc91:

    # ALCOTT "... Today is a special day for this kingdom."
    ALCOTT "... Hoje é um dia especial para este reino."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:436
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1e39f10a:

    # ALCOTT @ smile "It has been fourteen years since our war with the Demorai began. Fourteen years of sacrifices..."
    ALCOTT @ smile "Já se passaram catorze anos desde que nossa guerra com os Demorai começou. Catorze anos de sacrifícios..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:437
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4872ab72:

    # ALCOTT " Fourteen years of losses too great to put into words."
    ALCOTT "Catorze anos de perdas grandes demais para serem descritas em palavras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:438
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8be50508:

    # ALCOTT "Each of us has lost someone in this conflict, but the battle continues even now, with many of our kin away from home helping to secure and restore our once great kingdom!"
    ALCOTT "Cada um de nós perdeu alguém neste conflito, mas a batalha continua até agora, com muitos de nossos parentes longe de casa ajudando a assegurar e restaurar nosso outrora grandioso reino!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:439
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5dd048a4:

    # ALCOTT "The road ahead is hard, it is brutal... {i}and it is bloody.{/i} "
    ALCOTT "A estrada à frente é difícil, é brutal... {i}e é sangrenta.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:440
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a11fa683:

    # ALCOTT "But today is a day of new hope!"
    ALCOTT "Mas hoje é um dia de nova esperança!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:441
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a9388680:

    # ALCOTT "A day for a new generation to lead the fight!"
    ALCOTT "Um dia para uma nova geração liderar a luta!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:442
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a1dfe190:

    # ALCOTT "And we WILL be victorious in this conflict!"
    ALCOTT "E nós SEREMOS vitoriosos neste conflito!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:443
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7395f2c2:

    # ALCOTT "We will survive and we WILL thrive once again!"
    ALCOTT "Nós sobreviveremos e prosperaremos mais uma vez!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:444
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b5393478:

    # ALCOTT "And most importantly, we will do it for them!"
    ALCOTT "E o mais importante, faremos isso por eles!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:445
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fdf784a9:

    # ALCOTT "We will build the world they fought for, the world they wanted you to have!"
    ALCOTT "Construiremos o mundo pelo qual eles lutaram, o mundo que eles queriam que você tivesse!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:446
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5b213438:

    # ALCOTT "To those of you now bearing the responsibility of helping us restore this kingdom to its former glory, whether soldier or baker, blacksmith or humble street sweeper..."
    ALCOTT "A vocês que agora carregam a responsabilidade de nos ajudar a restaurar este reino à sua antiga glória, seja soldado ou padeiro, ferreiro ou humilde varredor de rua..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:447
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9a4b160d:

    # ALCOTT "I salute you!"
    ALCOTT "Eu os saúdo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:448
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_d9a239d2:

    # ALCOTT "HEIL!"
    ALCOTT "Ei!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:451
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4834d82f:

    # CROWD "HEIL EMPEROR ALCOTT! HEIL THE NEW ALDERIAN EMPIRE!"
    CROWD "HEIL IMPERADOR ALCOTT! HEIL O NOVO IMPÉRIO ALDERIANO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:452
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_debab30d:

    # ALCOTT "Go now and do your Emperor proud! Do your country proud and do yourselves proud!"
    ALCOTT "Vão agora e encham o vosso Imperador de orgulho! Encham o vosso país de orgulho e encham-se a vós próprios de orgulho!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:459
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bbe6fc24:

    # "And with that, Emperor Alcott descended from the podium, escorted back towards the fort from which he ruled and administered his government duties from."
    "E com isso, o Imperador Alcott desceu do pódio, escoltado de volta para o forte de onde governava e administrava as suas funções governamentais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:460
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_47d3e974:

    # "As he passed by me, he looked at me for a moment, with the coldest eyes I had ever seen, as though his gaze could cut through and freeze my very soul."
    "Quando passou por mim, olhou-me por um momento, com os olhos mais frios que eu alguma vez vira, como se o seu olhar pudesse cortar e congelar a minha própria alma."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:465
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a8edd937:

    # ADARA @ talk "He’s so scary..."
    ADARA @ talk "Ele é tão assustador..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:466
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_afc8cc1f:

    # MC "Yeah..."
    MC "Sim..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:467
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_49080373:

    # MARKUS "He might be scary, but without him this city would have fallen long ago."
    MARKUS "Ele pode ser assustador, mas sem ele esta cidade teria caído há muito tempo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:468
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_525dee60:

    # MARKUS "We need more leaders like him. Leaders who will do what has to be done."
    MARKUS "Precisamos de mais líderes como ele. Líderes que façam o que tem de ser feito."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:469
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6fa51ea6:

    # ADARA @ talk "Mmm, I’m not so sure... Not after deposing the King like that..."
    ADARA @ talk "Mmm, não tenho tanta certeza... Não depois de deporem o Rei daquela forma..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:470
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_db5a5efc:

    # MARKUS "Alcott led troops and repelled The Great Invasion from taking Novaras while the King continued to squander more troops lives pointlessly."
    MARKUS "Alcott liderou as tropas e repeliu a Grande Invasão de tomar Novaras, enquanto o Rei continuava a desperdiçar mais vidas de tropas inutilmente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:471
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_ae457738:

    # MARKUS "If it wasn’t for him, this place would have fallen in 1152."
    MARKUS "Se não fosse por ele, este lugar teria caído em 1152."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:472
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_48dd72c2:

    # ADARA @ talk "He also split the alliance in half with his little coup!"
    ADARA @ talk "Ele também dividiu a aliança ao meio com seu pequeno golpe!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:473
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_39239c03:

    # MC "Urgh, do you two need to keep arguing politics?"
    MC "Urgh, vocês dois precisam continuar discutindo política?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:474
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fc35ca54:

    # ADARA @ angry "Hmph..."
    ADARA @ angry "Hmph..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:475
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_fc582d37:

    # MARKUS "Alright, let’s just drop it."
    MARKUS "Tudo bem, vamos apenas deixar isso pra lá."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:476
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_315cc143:

    # MARKUS "Anyway, come on, it’s time we finally got our results, [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "De qualquer forma, vamos lá, é hora de finalmente vermos nossos resultados, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:477
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8bbd0124:

    # MC "Ah, right."
    MC "Ah, sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:478
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6fd5686c:

    # ADARA @ talk "Goodluck, guys, I best get in my queue as well!"
    ADARA @ talk "Boa sorte, pessoal, é melhor eu entrar na minha fila também!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:480
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bf5aeb7d:

    # MC "Good luck, Adara!"
    MC "Boa sorte, Adara!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:482
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_8da82e65:

    # MARKUS "Same, good luck to you."
    MARKUS "Igualmente, boa sorte para você."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:485
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_052cae9b:

    # "Each of us headed over to our respective queues, where hundreds of students would now wait for hours to receive the letter that would decide their life."
    "Cada um de nós foi para nossas respectivas filas, onde centenas de alunos agora esperariam por horas para receber a carta que decidiria sua vida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:486
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_488e3fc8:

    # "Sometimes, the wait would leave some to not find out until the early hours of the next morning..."
    "Às vezes, a espera fazia com que alguns só soubessem nas primeiras horas da manhã seguinte..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:487
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_19e073a7:

    # "After five hours, I finally arrived at the stall."
    "Depois de cinco horas, finalmente cheguei à barraca."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:489
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e7442a13:

    # "Markus had already come and gone half an hour before, after he’d managed to slip into the queue slightly ahead of me."
    "Markus já tinha ido e voltado meia hora antes, depois de conseguir entrar na fila um pouco à minha frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:490
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_386634eb:

    # "He’d promised to meet me afterwards outside his home, then we’d head out to celebrate together."
    "Ele tinha prometido me encontrar depois em frente à sua casa, e então sairíamos para comemorar juntos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:493
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_dedd2831:

    # "The woman looked up at me, smiling warmly."
    "A mulher olhou para mim, sorrindo calorosamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:494
translate ptPT qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3f349202:

    # WOMAN "Name?"
    WOMAN "Nome?"

